# Edit > Insert Dislocation: lattice detection, an edge dislocation in a
# replicated Cu crystal, Replace Main Scene as one undo step, and its loop
# drawn by View > Show > Dislocation Lines.
open docs/manual/examples/cu_fcc.cif
step replicate
set counts 6 6 6
apply
expect-atoms 864
dislocation open
dislocation detect
dislocation set character edge
dislocation set shape half-plane
dislocation generate
expect-shifted 100
dislocation replace
expect-loop 3
dislocation set character screw
dislocation generate
expect-shifted 100
undo
expect-atoms 864
reset-view
screenshot rust/target/ui/dislocation.png
quit
